# Eight and up: two Faults with the same symptom, so the first Repair changes nothing. A dry Joint on
# U12 pin 6 (D, L3): the leg floats high. And U10's 4Q (L3) stuck at 1. Either alone sets the units
# decoder's bit 3: 8 and 9 for 0 and 1, the shapes of 10-14 for 2-6, nothing for 7; 8 and 9 stay right.
machine knob
title "Eight and up"
brief "The right digit shows 8 or 9 where it should show 0 or 1, and odd shapes or nothing for the rest. This one may be a little trickier than it looks."
fault joint U12.6
fault stuck U10.4Q 1
